#. module: web_studio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:web_studio.field_studio_export_model__include_attachment
msgid ""
"If set, attachments related to the exported records will be included.\n"
"        This does not include the attachments uploaded in binary fields such "
"as pictures, files, etc.\n"
"        Include the corresponding fields in the export to get them."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ໄຟລ໌ແນບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລາຍການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໄປນຳ.\n"
"        ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລວມເຖິງໄຟລ໌ແນບທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດໃນຟິວ binary ເຊັ່ນ: ຮູບພາບ, ໄຟລ໌, ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"        ໃຫ້ລວມຟິວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: web_studio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:web_studio.field_studio_export_model__is_demo_data
msgid ""
"If set, the exported records will be considered as demo data during the "
"import."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ລາຍການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືວ່າເປັນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. module: web_studio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:web_studio.field_studio_approval_rule__domain
msgid "If set, the rule will only apply on records that match the domain."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ກົດລະບຽບຈະນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັບໂດເມນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: web_studio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:web_studio.field_studio_approval_rule__exclusive_user
msgid ""
"If set, the user who approves this rule will not be able to approve other "
"rules for the same record"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ອະນຸມັດກົດລະບຽບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອະນຸມັດກົດລະບຽບອື່ນໆ ສຳລັບລາຍການດຽວກັນນີ້ໄດ້ອີກ"

