msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນກຸ່ມນີ້ສາມາດອະນຸມັດ ຫຼື ປະຕິເສດຂັ້ນຕອນໄດ້."

#. module: web_studio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/web_studio/controllers/main.py:0
msgid ""
"There are %s records that use the values you are trying to remove.\n"
"Are you sure you want to get rid of them?"
msgstr ""
"ມີ %s ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານພະຍາຍາມລຶບ.\n"
"ທ່ານແນ່ໃຈບໍ່ວ່າຕ້ອງການລຶບຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກ?"

#. module: web_studio
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_studio/static/src/client_action/view_editor/interactive_editor/interactive_editor.js:0
msgid ""
"There are no many2one fields related to the current model.\n"
"\n"
"To create a one2many field on the current model, you must first create its "
"many2one counterpart on the model you want to relate to.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີຟິວ many2one ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຕົວແບບປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"\n"
"ເພື່ອສ້າງຟິວ one2many ໃນຕົວແບບປັດຈຸບັນ, ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງຟິວ many2one ທີ່ຄູ່ກັນໃນຕົວແບບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງຫາ.\n"

#. module: web_studio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/web_studio/models/studio_approval.py:0
